==Icelandic==
{{cardinalbox|is|0|1|2|tíu|tólf|ord=ellefti}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|ellifu}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*ainalif}}, a compound of {{m|gem-pro|*ainaz}} and {{m|gem-pro|*lif-}}. Compare Faroese {{m|fo|ellivu}}, Norwegian and Danish {{m|no|elleve}}, Swedish {{m|sv|elva}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɛtlɛvʏ/|lang=is}}

===Cardinal number===
{{head|is|numeral}}

# [[eleven]]; the cardinal number after [[tíu#Icelandic|tíu]] and before [[tólf#Icelandic|tólf]].

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') [[ellefti]] {{g|m}}, [[ellefta]] {{g|f|n}}

